Omioc
$cards
DECK 2 {SPADES, HEARTS, CLUBS, DIAMONDS}

$initial
DRAW 85 DEAL KIW
KIW 4 FACE_HALF
KIW 2 FACE_HALF
KIW 7 FACE_HALF
KIW 0 FACE_HALF
KIW 1 FACE_HALF
KIW 5 FACE_HALF
KIW 0 FACE_HALF

$moves
MOVE KIW KIW
AND
    OR
        DEST Empty
        DESTSRC Suit match
    AND
        DEST Suit {DIAMONDS, SPADES}
        DESTSRC Rank add_13
MOVE_STACK KIW KIW
DEST Size > 8
DRAW
PILE ANY DRAW Size > 0
$win
AND
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
    PILE ALL KIW Empty
